⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
293 calories 37g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included) 😋🤤
Phish Food Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake
- 25g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins/Toppings:
- 15g mini marshmallows
- 6g caramel syrup
- ½ of a @Hormbles Chormbles (protein chocolate bar with 100 cal and 10g pro)
293 cal 27g C, 7g F, 37g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with chocolate and marshmallows
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
8. Top with caramel syrup

